## Domain Controller Deployment

DC01 was promoted as the first domain controller for a new
Active Directory forest.

### Domain

corp.rosalietech.local

### Services

DC01 currently provides:

- Active Directory Domain Services
- DNS
- Authentication services

### Configuration Decisions

A static IP address of 192.168.10.10 was assigned to the
domain controller because infrastructure services such as
DNS and Active Directory should have a predictable network
address.

DC01 uses itself as its preferred DNS server because DNS is
integrated with the Active Directory environment.
